 I have created a recipe Index for the Non-Vegetarian Recipes. Soon would be doing for the Veg Recipes too. You can go through the list of recipes in this blog. Hope it would be easy for you to search your favorites recipes.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 4.278541200008476}
